---
layout: base.njk
title: About
---
<section class="about-section wrap">
  <h1>About</h1>
  <p>{{ site.nameLine1 }} {{ site.nameLine2 }} is an independent student magazine at the American University in Bulgaria. We publish online year-round and in print each semester — stories, essays and photography made by students, about the place we're all temporarily from.</p>
  <p>We're not affiliated with any university office, and we like it that way. Nobody assigns our stories but us.</p>
</section>

<section class="contact-box wrap">
  <p class="eyebrow">Submissions</p>
  <h2>Have something to send us?</h2>
  <p>We read everything — personal narratives, essays, features, photo essays, and anything else that fits under creative nonfiction. Submissions are open year-round and reviewed blind.</p>
  <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}" class="email-link">{{ site.email }}</a>
</section>

<section class="team-section wrap">
  <div class="team-list">
    {%- for member in team.members %}
    <div class="team-member">
      <h3>{{ member.name }}</h3>
      <p class="role">{{ member.role }}</p>
      <p>{{ member.bio }}</p>
    </div>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
